A '''cantina''' was located in [[Unidentified town (Lau)|an unnamed town]] on the [[planet]] [[Lau]]. [[Omega]] and [[Crosshair]], fugitives of the [[Galactic Empire]], temporarily sought refuge there. Their plan was for Omega to earn enough [[Galactic Credit Standard|credits]] through a game of [[sabacc]] to secure transportation off the planet.<ref name="A Different Approach" />

